flowchart TD
    Input[role, targetPackage, useResume, resume] --> HasResume{useResume?}
    HasResume -->|Yes| Select[Select candidate context fields]
    HasResume -->|No| Empty[Set resume context to null]
    Select --> Messages[Build system and human messages]
    Empty --> Messages
    Messages --> LLM[ChatGroq llm.invoke]
    LLM --> Clean[Strip JSON fences]
    Clean --> Parse{JSON.parse}
    Parse -->|Success| Normalize[Normalize level and difficulty capitalization]
    Normalize --> Output[Merge roadmap into state]
    Parse -->|Error| Catch[Log and rethrow]
    LLM -->|Provider error| Catch
